@startuml SequenceCallEndAndMediaResume
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Driver" as Driver
participant "Steering Wheel / HMI" as HMI
participant "TelephonyService\n(Call Manager)" as Telephony
participant "AudioPolicyManager\n(CarAudioService)" as AudioPolicy
participant "MediaPlaybackService\n(Audio Player)" as Media
participant "DisplayManager\n(Window Manager)" as Display
participant "Audio HAL / Speakers" as Speakers

== Initial State: In-Call Ongoing, Media Paused with Auto-Resume Pending ==
note over Media, Telephony
  Focus Stack:
    Top: TelephonyService (STREAM_VOICE_CALL)
    Bottom: MediaPlaybackService (STREAM_MEDIA, auto_resume_pending=true)
end note

== Step 1: Call Termination Event ==
Driver -> HMI: Press Phone Red Button (Hang Up)
HMI -> Telephony: endCall()
activate Telephony
Telephony -> Telephony: state = IDLE
Telephony -> AudioPolicy: abandonAudioFocus(service.telephony)
activate AudioPolicy
Telephony -> Display: publish("telephony/call_ended")
deactivate Telephony

== Step 2: Audio Focus Arbitration & Restoration ==
note over AudioPolicy
  Focus Stack Resolution:
  1. Pop 'service.telephony' from stack.
  2. Inspect next candidate: 'service.media_playback'
  3. Grant permanent AUDIOFOCUS_GAIN to Media.
end note

AudioPolicy -> Media: onAudioFocusChange(AUDIOFOCUS_GAIN)
activate Media
deactivate AudioPolicy

== Step 3: Media Evaluates Resume Intent ==
alt auto_resume_pending == true AND previous_state == PAUSED_TRANSIENT_LOSS
  Media -> Media: state = PLAYING
  Media -> Media: auto_resume_pending = false
  Media -> Media: volume = 0.0 -> ramp to 1.0 (smooth fade-in)
  Media -> Speakers: Resume audio stream at saved position (e.g., 01:45)
  Media -> Display: publish("media/state_changed", state=PLAYING)
  Speakers --> Driver: Music smoothly fades back in!
else auto_resume_pending == false (User paused manually prior to call)
  Media -> Media: state remains PAUSED_BY_USER
  note over Media: Do NOT play audio. Respect driver's manual pause!
end
deactivate Media

== Step 4: Display View Restoration ==
activate Display
Display -> Display: layout = FULL_NAVIGATION
Display --> Driver: Center screen transitions back to Full Map view
deactivate Display

@enduml
